From: Karin-Laboratory contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: serial: mediatek: document observed MT6873 alias

The B-unit boot_b FDT reports the UART compatible pair
mediatek,mt6873-uart / mediatek,mt6577-uart. The Linux 6.18.55 driver has
the explicit mt6577 fallback match; this records the firmware-reported first
string without claiming a separate MT6873 driver implementation.

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/mediatek,uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/mediatek,uart.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/mediatek,uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/mediatek,uart.yaml
@@ -35,4 +35,5 @@ properties:
               - mediatek,mt6795-uart
               - mediatek,mt6797-uart
+              - mediatek,mt6873-uart
               - mediatek,mt6893-uart
               - mediatek,mt7622-uart
